<card id="c" title="Gusinje Bus Stop: Where the Bus to Podgorica and Plav Actually Stops">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p><b>42.56583, 19.83322</b> — <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=42.56583,19.83322">open the pin in Google Maps</a></p>
<p>The bus that pulls in here is Elan Company, heading to Plav and on to Podgorica.</p>
<p><b>Gusinje to Podgorica bus</b></p>
<p>The bus that pulls in at this stop runs to Podgorica four times a day, calling at Plav first.</p>
<p><b>Departure times</b></p>
<p>- <b>05:46</b> — Elan Company</p>
<p>- <b>12:21</b> — Elan Company</p>
<p>- <b>15:45</b> — Elan Company</p>
<p>- <b>16:45</b> — Arena Tours</p>
<p>Four a day, all of them through Plav first.</p>
<p><b>Why a 47 km trip takes four hours</b></p>
